        "original_id": "c24f2d54-4ba8-56ed-a6a9-2e75485791e7",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jeff Sheehy, Ed Lee, Scott Wiener, Gavin Newsom\n- Organizations: Board of Supervisors, California State Senate\n- Roles: Mayor of San Francisco, Supervisor, Lieutenant Governor of California\n\nFacts:\n- On January 11, 2011, the Board of Supervisors appointed Ed Lee to serve out the remainder of former mayor Gavin Newsom's term after Gavin Newsom resigned to take office as Lieutenant Governor of California.\n- In January 2017, Mayor Ed Lee appointed Jeff Sheehy to the Board to succeed Supervisor Scott Wiener after Scott Wiener resigned his seat to take office as a member of the California State Senate.",
